-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",12,{
[353]="700374F9\n1\tSiege-craft and war machines can be found in Shatorthum. You should examine the different types of weapons to learn of the technology that Isengard harbours.\t\n2\tCompleted\tSaruman's interest in war machinery has grown of late, for he now employs many siege-weapons for his intended attack upon Helm's Deep. Hopefully you can help the defenders of Helm's Deep with your knowledge of the enemy.\n",
[354]="7002C8CA\n1\tBring the gift of hides to Wynmar at his new camp\tWynmar and his men are at their new temporary camp on the southern river-bank of Thinglad. You should bring the hides to Wynmar as a final parting gift, a token of good will from the Elves.\n",
[355]="7006AFF5\n1\tTalk to Sharûla outside her manor in the Upper Ward\tSharûla's manor can be found in the north-east reaches of the Upper Ward, just west of the Tor-gardens.\n2\tExamine Sharûla's ledgers\030Examine Sharûla's papers\tSharûla has invited you to study the documents and ledgers she has provided for Hármelak's perusal.\n3\tTalk to Sharûla outside her manor in the Upper Ward\tSharûla stands outside her manor in the north-east reaches of the Upper Ward, just west of the Tor-gardens.\n4\tTalk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja\tHármelak is inside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, waiting for your report of Sharûla's accounts.\n",
[356]="7006AFF9\n1\tCollect clear and straightforward records from smugglers within Tâkhdar (total: 10)\tSmugglers within Tâkhdar, the Cellars of Umbar-môkh beneath the city, may possess records that will shed light upon Sharûla's misdeeds.\n2\tBring the confused records to Hármelak in Dâr Laja\tHármelak is inside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, waiting for you to return from Tâkhdar with proof of Sharûla's misdeeds.\n",
[357]="7006AFFB\n1\tReturn to Sharûla's manor unannounced and unheralded\tHármelak wants you to return to Sharûla's manor in the north-eastern Upper Ward, on the edge of the Tor-gardens... but this time she wants you to return unannounced.\n2\tTalk to Zakhâz outside Sharûla's manor\tSharûla's steward, Zakhâz, guards the entrance to her manor in the Upper Ward.\n3\tWait for Zakhâz to make his decision\tZakhâz appears to be struggling with a difficult decision.\n4\tTalk to Zakhâz outside Sharûla's manor\tSharûla's steward, Zakhâz, guards the entrance to her manor in the Upper Ward.\n",
[358]="7006AFF6\n1\tFind Sharûla's second, secret residence in Tâkhdar\tAccording to Zakhâz, the entrance to Sharûla's second, secret residence is located in Tâkhdar, south of the stairs to Dâr Laja.\n2\tDefeat Azagath loyalists in Sharûla's secret residence (total: 5)\tSupporters of Azagath Sea-shadow come and go frequently throughout Sharûla's secret residence.\n3\tSearch the lockbox in Sharûla's secret residence\tA lockbox in the middle of Sharûla's secret residence may contain evidence of her support for Azagath Sea-shadow.\n4\tBring the incriminating documents to Hármelak in Dâr Laja\tHármelak is in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja. She will be pleased to see the documents you recovered that suggest Sharûla has continued funding Azagath's assorted ventures.\n",
[359]="7006AFF8\n1\tCollect Hármelak's order of shiny swords from the Swain's Guild-hall (total: 4)\tHármelak's order of fresh swords for her personal guardsmen is ready to be picked up inside the Swain's Guild-hall.\n2\tBring the shiny swords to Jaith outside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\tJaith stands guard outside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja. He is waiting to receive the swords Hármelak ordered from the Swain's Guild-hall.\n3\tTalk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja\tHármelak is inside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja, waiting for your report that her swords have been delivered.\n",
[360]="7006AFFA\n1\tTalk to Dayêri in Kheb Hanût\tHármelak asked you to speak to merchants in the market of Kheb Hanût in north-west Tâkhdar and learn if any of them share Sharûla's loyalty to Azagath.\n2\tTalk to Nagamûn in Kheb Hanût\tHármelak asked you to speak to merchants in the market of Kheb Hanût in north-west Tâkhdar and learn if any of them share Sharûla's loyalty to Azagath.\n3\tTalk to Okhmath in Kheb Hanût\tHármelak asked you to speak to merchants in the market of Kheb Hanût in north-west Tâkhdar and learn if any of them share Sharûla's loyalty to Azagath.\n4\tTalk to Lashêm in Kheb Hanût\tHármelak asked you to speak to merchants in the market of Kheb Hanût in north-west Tâkhdar and learn if any of them share Sharûla's loyalty to Azagath.\n",
[361]="7006AFFC\n1\tDefeat smugglers operating in Tâkhdar (total: 12)\030Recover Lashêm's misplaced parcels in Sâl Bajat (total: 5)\tLashêm's parcels were \"misplaced\" by a number of smugglers operating out of Sâl Bajat, and he needs you to recover them and teach the miscreants he will not be intimidated.\n2\tBring the misplaced parcels to Lashêm in Kheb Hanût\tLashêm is waiting for you to deliver his misplaced parcels to him at Kheb Hanût, in Tâkhdar.\n",
[362]="7006AFF7\n1\tThe sound of approaching footsteps!\tThe sound of approaching footsteps echoes throughout Kheb Hanût.\n2\tTalk to Hármelak's guardsman\tHármelak's guards hold Lashêm at swordpoint.\n3\tTalk to Lashêm in Kheb Hanût\tLashêm stands in disbelief, surrounded by guardsmen.\n4\tTalk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja\tHármelak is in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja. Perhaps she will explain to you why Lashêm has been apprehended.\n",
[363]="70012CDF\n1\tFind the first mirror\030Find the second mirror\030Find the third mirror\030Find the fourth mirror\tThe four mirrors can be found at the corners of the Twenty-first Hall in Zelem-melek. You should find the mirrors and record the rotation and locations of them.\n2\tReturn to Darri at the Twenty-first Hall\tThe dwarf Darri can be found in the Twenty-first Hall in Moria. Having found several unbroken mirrors, you should return to Darri and report your success.\n",
[364]="700160EC\n1\tSpeak with Drafli\tDrafli is in the Shadowed Refuge in the western reaches of the Foundations of Stone. You should tell Drafli that you have re-aligned the mirror.\n",
[365]="7006EEE1\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír.\n",
[366]="70028251\n1\tTalk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales\tIlar is at his camp in the Bonevales. You should bring the chain-link you found to Ilar.\n",
[367]="7002EFF0\n1\tCollect glowing flowers in the side passages of the Under-wall (total: 6)\tGlowing flowers can be found in the corners of the side passages in the Under-wall. Isteron wants you to collect some of the glowing flowers in the Under-wall so he can study their properties.\n2\tBring the glowing flowers to Isteron\tIsteron is by the northernmost exit from the Under-wall. You have collected glowing flowers from the corners of the side passages in the Under-wall.\n",
[368]="70045444\n1\tDefeat Ghûrdhos (total: 10)\tGhûrdhos can be found throughout the Drúadan Forest. You should defeat Ghûrdhos.\n2\tSpeak with Ghân-buri-Ghân\tGhân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.\n",
[369]="70028CF7\n1\tSearch for Leolin\tLeolin, a friend of Luned, is late to return from his early morning venture onto Pren Gwydh's road. You should search for Leolin and encourage him to return to Galtrev to put his friend's fears to rest.\n2\tTalk to Luned at Galtrev\tLuned is at Galtrev, worriedly awaiting news of her late friend. You should break the news that Leolin met an untimely end at the hands of a Warg.\n",
[370]="700577E5\n1\tGive Madelgard Túcca's home a good dusting (total: 10)\tMadelgard Túcca's home can be found in Lyndelby. You should give Madelgard Túcca's home a good dusting.\n2\tTalk to Madelgard Túcca in Lyndelby\tMadelgard Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Madelgard Túcca.\n",
[371]="7002844F\n1\tDefeat Stone-trolls in the uruk-encampment (total: 3)\tStone-trolls patrol the uruk-encampment in eastern Nan Curunír. Quickbeam asked you to take the strange draught he provided and try splashing it upon the Stone-trolls. It may serve to soothe them or render them sleepy, as it is meant to do with the Huorns.\n2\tTalk to Quickbeam\tTell Quickbeam how the draught affected the trolls.\n",
[372]="70027256\n1\tCollect piles of oozing corruption in the South Gravenwood (total: 8)\tAndreg has asked you to collect leaves and bark covered in the strange corruption so that Saeradan might be able to examine it.\n2\tBring the piles of oozing corruption to Andreg\tYou should bring the corrupted materials you collected to Andreg.\n",
[373]="70002C6E\n1\tSearch Trestlebridge for the cause of the explosion (total: 3)\tA clue to the great boom heard in Trestlebridge may be found somewhere in town. Aggy Digweed has asked you to search for the source of the mayhem that ruined Trestlebridge the previous night.\n2\tBring the powder to Captain Trotter\tCaptain Trotter can be found in Trestlebridge. You should bring the powder you found to Captain Trotter.\n",
[374]="7000C389\n1\tDefeat the Great Goblin\tThe Great Goblin is in the throne room of Goblin-town, to the north-east of Glóin's camp. Glóin spoke with a heavy heart of the evil that looms at the centre of Goblin-town. He then asked you to enter the evil place and defeat the Great Goblin before his threat grows too large to contain.\n2\tSpeak with Glóin at his camp in the Misty Mountains.\tGlóin is at his camp, just outside the entrance to Goblin-town. You entered Goblin-town and searched deep into the heart of the place for the throne room. There, you defeated Ashûrz, the Great Goblin. With his defeat, you have sundered the strength of the goblins in Goblin-town and lessened the threat they present against the people east and west of the Misty Mountains. You should return to Glóin with your report.\n",
[375]="7002EF3C\n1\tFind Mordor steel on the Easterlings\tThe Easterlings at the South Undeep bear the steel of Mordor, and are clearly allies of the Enemy.\n2\tFind Mordor steel on the Easterlings (total: 10)\tMordor steel can be found on the Easterlings who are attempting to invade the Wold by way of the South Undeep. You should collect Mordor steel to show to the Thane.\n3\tBring the Mordor steel to Adbert\tAdbert can be found at the northern-most watch-tower in the Wold. You should bring the Mordor steel you found to the watchman and see what he makes of it.\n",
[376]="70041171\n1\tTalk to Harnion in Tarlang's Crown\tHarnion can be found off the side of the road leading through Tarlang's Crown, to the north of Edhellond. Elaglar has asked you to seek Harnion in Tarlang's Crown and investigate the Corsair forces massing there.\n",
[377]="70020DA8\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair to the east of the boulder. You should bring news of the crushed boulder and skeleton to the Rangers of the Grey Company, for it may portend a greater foe than you have previously encountered.\n",
[378]="70000048\n1\tBring the trade-bundles to Gadaric Munce\030Collect trade-bundles (total: 10)\tGadaric's crates can be found within the ruins of Minas Eriol, south-east of The Forsaken Inn, where Gadaric waits for your return. In an effort to assist the Gadaric of the Eglain, you agreed to collect the trade-goods that were left behind at Minas Eriol when the goblins attacked.\n",
[379]="7002C5A1\n1\tCollect bundles of grass (total: 12)\tGreen grass grows all over the rocky plains of Eorlsmead. You should collect bundles of grass to feed to the horses of Stangard.\n2\tThe horses of Stangard are in the stables of the city. You should bring the grass you collected to Tatwine.\t\n3\tTalk to Tatwine\tTatwine is in Stangard. You should speak with Tatwine now that you have provided the horses with a better meal.\n",
[380]="7002EF17\n1\tTalk to Wadel\t\n2\tTalk to Wadel\tWadel is hiding in the brush near the ruins of his home in Thornhope. You should escort Wadel to safety.\n3\tTalk to Wadel at Béortnoth's camp\tWadel is at Béortnoth's camp, outside of Thornhope. You should speak with Wadel when you return to Béortnoth's camp.\n",
[381]="7002CB72\n1\tCollect sigils from brigands in Ost Celebrant (total: 8)\tBrigands are camped throughout Ost Celebrant.\n2\tTalk to Doron\tDoron is within Ost Celebrant. If he has left your side, he can be summoned with your horn.\n",
[382]="70067F80\n1\tSpeak with Heshra, the herbalist, in the Khûtra Elder Hall\tElder Roshat has told you to speak with Heshra, the herbalist in the Khûtra Elder Hall, about the disease overtaking Khûtra.\n2\tReturn to Heshra in Khûtra\030Collect diseased salamander stomachs ([see journal]/10)\tHeshra needs your help tracking down diseased salamanders west of Khûtra along the shore in order to find out more about this strange disease.\n",
[383]="7006EEEA\n1\tWarn Amalíbi in Ghalbûru about Bârshud's advance\tWarn Amalíbi at Ghalbûru's highest point about Bârshud's advance. Ghalbûru is located within Khûd Zagin, in the Ikorbân Valley.\n2\tWarn Girhâzi in Iridír about Bârshud's advance\tWarn Girhâzi in Iridír about Bârshud's advance. Iridír is located within Ambarûl, in the Ikorbân Valley.\n3\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír.\n",
[384]="70040148\n1\tHelp Túmir try to cheer up Fuirion\030Help Míreth try to cheer up Fuirion\tMíreth and Túmir are in Gladion's home in northern Lamedon. You should see if the children can think of anything to cheer up their uncle, as they know him best.\n2\tGo outside to give Fuirion some space and time to think\tYou should go outside of Gladion's home to give Fuirion some space to think upon his niece's and nephew's kind gestures.\n",
})
